         <title><![CDATA[Jury acquits man of murder, attempted murder of trio of 16-year-old boys]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/ottawa/jury-acquits-man-of-murder-attempted-murder-of-trio-of-16-year-old-boys-9.7435745?cmp=rss</link>
         <description><![CDATA[<img src='https://i.cbc.ca/ais/1.6851529,1684791325000/full/max/0/default.jpg?im=Crop%2Crect%3D%280%2C0%2C4032%2C2268%29%3B' alt='A police vehicle is parked on a residential street, with an orange barrier in the foreground.' width='620' height='349' title='Ontario Provincial Police investigate a double homicide in Pembroke, Ont., on May 22, 2023.'/><p>More than three years after two boys were shot to death and another boy's throat was slashed in a Pembroke, Ont., apartment, a jury has acquitted an Ottawa man of first-degree murder and attempted murder. Earlier this month, jurors agreed with the defence that the drug dealer might not have known of any plan to kill anyone.</p>]]></description>
